<strong>出門即是多線公車站牌，走路八分鐘可到府中捷運站.騎車三分鐘即可到達板橋車站（四鐵共構）、臨近南雅夜市&nbsp;<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>＊娛樂超方便：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>步行五分鐘即可到板橋體育場，騎車三分鐘即可到達板橋後站、遠東百貨、縣政府廣場，騎車五分鐘到達南雅夜市、板橋錢櫃KTV、好樂迪KTV。&nbsp;<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>＊出入超安全：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>大門進出入設有感應器、走道設有攝影機、房門設有安全防盜鏈、樓層中設有滅火器設備。&nbsp;<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>＊設備超齊全：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>附雙人床組&nbsp;冷氣&nbsp;液晶電視&nbsp;冰箱&nbsp;洗衣機&nbsp;書桌&nbsp;衣櫃&nbsp;全新衛浴設備&nbsp;12加侖電熱水器&nbsp;大門口晶片密碼鎖&nbsp;專人清理垃圾&nbsp;。&nbsp;<br>(保證讓你看了會喜歡的舒適環境)&nbsp;<br></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>租金10800元</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>歡迎來電預約看屋0932001135&nbsp;</strong></span></p>"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "undefined undefinedundefinedundefined巷undefined弄undefined號", "data": []}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "10,800元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "管理費、水費、網路、第四台、清潔費", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "6坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "-", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "無", "key": "lift", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "隔間材料", "value": "水泥磚牆", "key": "spacematerial", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "裝潢程度", "value": "中檔裝潢", "key": "decorate", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "其他特色", "value": "近捷運、可報稅、拎包入住、隨時可遷入", "key": "tags", "alias":